        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-761, Leaf and Berries Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Decorative Leaf Cabinet Knob gives the impression of the natural world with its subtle design. We especially like this pull because its design is so subtle, not drawing too much attention to the leaf design at the edge. It is a great addition to any space. Made by RK International, this beautiful cabinet pull is available in two sizes and 6 finishes including the very popular satin nickel (pictured). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/decorative-leaf-bow-pull-rk-international-cp-5617\"><b>Decorative Leaf Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/decorative-leaf-cabinet-rose-rk-international-bp-489\"><b>Decorative Leaf Cabinet Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-761 Leaf at Edge Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-761:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-760:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
